diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..d61e757
--- /dev/null
+++ b/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,26 @@
+# Helpdesk API
+
+Rails 8 API-only backend for account-scoped helpdesk users. PostgreSQL is configured exclusively from `DATABASE_URL`.
+
+## Configuration
+
+- `DATABASE_URL`: PostgreSQL connection URL (required).
+- `HELPDESK_FRONTEND_URL`: frontend base URL; defaults to `http://localhost:3001`.
+- `HELPDESK_MAIL_FROM`: mail sender; defaults to `support@example.test`.
+
+Run `bundle install`, `bin/rails db:prepare`, and `bin/rails server` to start the API.
+
+All endpoints are available under `/api/v1` and unprefixed compatibility paths. JSON clients select an account with `X-Helpdesk-Account: SUBDOMAIN`. Authenticated requests send `Authorization: Bearer TOKEN`.
+
+Core endpoints:
+
+- `POST /api/v1/account/create`
+- `GET /api/v1/portal`
+- `GET /api/v1/account`
+- `POST /api/v1/sessions` and `DELETE /api/v1/session`
+- `GET /api/v1/me`, `PATCH /api/v1/me`, and `PUT /api/v1/me/password`
+- `POST /api/v1/email_verifications` and `POST /api/v1/email_verifications/confirm`
+- `POST /api/v1/password_resets` and `POST /api/v1/password_resets/confirm`
+- `POST /api/v1/account/cancel` and `POST /api/v1/account/reactivate`
+
+Cancelled accounts are blocked from ordinary access, revoke all sessions, and may be reactivated by their owner for 90 days. Run `bin/rails helpdesk:purge_cancelled_accounts` to permanently remove accounts past that window and cascade their data deletion.
